    dims=[("identity","Programme, enrolment, qualification, award, credential, transcript and recognition identities and issuers are explicit."),("classification and definition","ISCED, qualification-framework, award and credential classes are versioned and non-equivalent."),("direct properties","Programme rules, enrolment, outcomes, results, grades, credits, award claims and credential status are first-class."),("recognition and observation","Assessment, issuer, proof, status and recognition methods, evidence, time and confidence are covered."),("capabilities and possible actions","Register, enrol, complete, assess, award, issue, correct, recognize, verify and project operations are governed."),("composition","People, institutions, content, activities, assessments, skills, occupations, licences, consent and proof systems stay external."),("lifecycle","Admission, enrolment, progress, result, award, issue, correction, reissue, suspension, revocation and tombstone preserve history."),("relationships","Learner, provider, registrar, assessor, awarding body, issuer, verifier and recognizing authority are typed and time-qualified."),("temporal","Learning, assessment, decision, conferral, issue, revocation, verification and ingestion times remain distinct."),("spatial","Jurisdiction, delivery location and recognition territory are referenced when material and privacy-controlled."),("provenance","Sources, assessors, decisions, derivations, revisions, mappings and presentations remain attributable."),("ownership and stewardship","Learner interests, registrar custody, awarding authority, issuer status and recognizing authority remain separate."),("validation and quality","Identity, authority, rules, scales, credit, evidence, status, mapping loss and stale verification are checked."),("access and privacy","Minimum disclosure, sealed records, subject binding, consent, verifier purpose and audit are covered."),("retention and deletion","Appeals, statutory retention, holds, correction, revocation status and tombstones are explicit."),("interoperability","ISCED, EQF, national frameworks, ESCO, CTDL, CLR, Open Badges and VC mappings are versioned and loss-aware.")]
    return {"claim":"Covers a learner-centred education and qualification context from frameworks and enrolment through outcomes, awards, credentials, recognition, privacy and exchange.","confidence":"medium","checklist":[{"dimension":d,"status":"covered","notes":n} for d,n in dims],"known_omissions":["No independent Claude or Grok result was available; later external and education-sector review is required before canonical promotion.","National programme, credit, grade, framework, award, recognition, minor-learner, sealed-record, retention and appeal profiles require specialist review.","Teaching content and events, assessment execution, skills and occupation taxonomies, professional licences, payments, immigration and proof infrastructure remain external.","The frozen relation ledger contains no approved WM-PER-008 rows; composition targets remain draft.","Certified ISCED, EQF, ESCO, CTDL, CLR, Open Badges and VC crosswalks, conformance tests and licence review remain future work."],"conflicts":["Framework levels support comparability but do not prove qualification equivalence or recognition for a particular purpose.","A credential can be revoked, reissued or unavailable while the underlying learning or award remains historically true, and an award can be corrected without erasing completed learning.","Registrar, awarding body, credential issuer and recognizing authority may be different parties with conflicting assertions."],"regional_assumptions":["The EQF and ESCO supply European profiles and do not create universal levels, recognition or rights.","ISCED is a statistical classification and does not itself accredit a programme or confer a qualification.","CLR, Open Badges and Verifiable Credentials are exchange formats and do not determine educational quality, award authority or legal recognition."],"adversarial_checks":["Reject attendance or course completion represented as assessed achievement, qualification, award or professional authorization without explicit evidence.","Reject a qualification identity derived only from title, provider name, learner, grade or date.","Reject mapped credits, grades or levels that omit original system, scale, version, authority and non-equivalence caveat.","Reject public verification that leaks full transcript, sealed records, unnecessary identifiers or unrelated achievements.","Reject agent conferral, recognition, revocation, adverse correction or disclosure beyond current role, authority, purpose and confirmation class."]}

